#kaocha/v1
{:tests
 [{:id :unit
   ;; The default suite runs on stubs only: no test in it reaches a tmux
   ;; server, ~/.claude or a clock (convention 20261111105238).
   ;;
   ;; ^:e2e tests drive a REAL tmux through libtmux. Each builds its own
   ;; private server (`tmux -L hive-e2e-<uuid>`, killed by its fixture), so
   ;; even a run that drops this skip cannot touch the operator's server.
   ;; Skipping by metadata keeps them visible as skipped in the count.
   ;; Run them deliberately:
   ;;   clojure -M:test --focus-meta :e2e
   :kaocha.filter/skip-meta [:e2e :integration]}]}
